# TodoToday – Cursor rules

- This project is standalone. Do not reference or depend on tb-digital-dev or any other workspace.
- All code, assets, and generated files live under Desktop/TodoToday (or the repo root if this repo is TodoToday only).
- Use componentized React; keep UI and storage concerns separate.
- Persistence is JSON via Electron IPC; no backend server.
- When adding features (e.g. search), preserve unique task IDs and existing data shape for compatibility.
